{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-22","kind":"proposition","title":"用满足三角不等式的三条线段构造三角形","englishTitle":"Out of three straight lines, which are equal to three given straight lines, to construct a triangle: thus it is necessary that two of the straight lines taken together in any manner should be greater than the remaining one. [I. 20]","book":1,"number":22,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.22","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.22/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":22,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","contentId":"euclid-1-22","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e1d02aca178e6d38a2ba9d5e34d73f1732191a95930fedba73ad08e800ef155d","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-22.statement","euclid-1-22.construction.1","euclid-1-22.construction.2","euclid-1-22.construction.3","euclid-1-22.proof.1","euclid-1-22.proof.2","euclid-1-22.proof.3","euclid-1-22.proof.4","euclid-1-22.proof.5","euclid-1-22.proof.6","euclid-1-22.conclusion","euclid-1-22.historical.1","euclid-1-22.historical.2","euclid-1-22.historical.3","euclid-1-22.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-22.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-22","revisionId":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2f398160041ad80739bba47e569e4f2decd18e40719bbb916e81f8d56ef94b36","citations":["euclid-1-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Out of three straight lines, which are equal to three given straight lines, to construct a triangle: thus it is necessary that two of the straight lines taken together in any manner should be greater than the remaining one. [[I. 20](/principles/euclid-1-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在相当于三条给定直线的三条直线中,建造一个三角形:因此,必须使以任何方式组合起来的两条直线大于其余一条直线。 [[I. 20](/principles/euclid-1-20)]"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三直线求作三角形其每两线并大于一线也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"画三条直线形成一个三角形，其中其两条线都大于一条线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-22.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-22","revisionId":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f20b8f32b02fee0aaa28ffa6f48b86561934386fc1583e3eba0f98796210cfa0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the three given straight lines be A, B, C, and of these let two taken together in any manner be greater than the remaining one, namely A, B greater than C, A, C greater than B, and B, C greater than A; thus it is required to construct a triangle out of straight lines equal to A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"这三个直线线应为A,B,C,其中两个直线的组合无论如何都大于其余直线,即A,B大于C,A,C大于B,B大于A;因此,需要从直线中建造一个三角形,等于A,B,C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-22.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-22","revisionId":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"155231cbadb90db5db52fd1caf38ff40ef79979fff25fbd0aa715fd96b2e235c","citations":["euclid-1-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be set out a straight line DE, terminated at D but of infinite length in the direction of E, and let DF be made equal to A, FG equal to B, and GH equal to C. [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"以D时终止但长度无限的E分线DE分线,DF分线等于A、FG分等于B分,GH分等于C分。 [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-22.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-1-22","revisionId":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b802ff70aab33b02ae96db5495f8b832b41a46f15e9cf5e3c4828d9bd699f1bc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"With centre F and distance FD let the circle DKL be described; again, with centre G and distance GH let the circle KLH be described; and let KF, KG be joined;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"以F和FD中点,说明DKL圆;以G和GH中点,说明KLH圆;让KF、KG圆连接;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-22.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-22","revisionId":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9fcce0b2a8c8d5088017b5dd00d6fc83cdfa6f1dc4d9f08ba87f359069678166","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the triangle KFG has been constructed out of three straight lines equal to A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,三角形KFG是由三条直线组成的,等于A,B,C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-22.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-22","revisionId":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fcab25461f5a6674f63c8b8b2199b5da8628d1a0faea2da69a3614d1d2e98440","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the point F is the centre of the circle DKL, FD is equal to FK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,由于F点是DKL点的中心,FD点等于FK点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-22.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-22","revisionId":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b5f42875aad6cae45d828113232d5fa72bbac328b04b845b94161542f04981c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But FD is equal to A; therefore KF is also equal to A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FD等于A,因此KF也等于A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-22.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-22","revisionId":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e4de025570d1d1344930087dba7ce3cdf881bd6fa05078778112c8a7c8653525","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the point G is the centre of the circle LKH, GH is equal to GK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于G点是LKH点的中心,GH点等于GK点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-22.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-22","revisionId":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3c2358f0e4482d4c39cb35e3e57a25655fb59c776da6f7f708751e22cbc7e6b4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But GH is equal to C; therefore KG is also equal to C. And FG is also equal to B; therefore the three straight lines KF, FG, GK are equal to the three straight lines A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但GH等于C,KG也等于C,FG也等于B;因此,330条直线KF、FG、GK等等于3条直线A、B、C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-22.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-22","revisionId":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6114ce4f69a96b664e54610740f4d532ad389d820192618481b4a3be4c28f7a6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore out of the three straight lines KF, FG, GK, which are equal to the three given straight lines A, B, C, the triangle KFG has been constructed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在3条直线KF、FG、GK(相当于3条直线A、B、C)中,三角KFG已经建成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-22.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-22","revisionId":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e432e38b0000ec6ee99e2e8d764f4fbbb98aaaef6b326a175b8cd06205cc0c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所求作图完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-22.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-22","revisionId":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a13418cd4b05a221e080e8f9e04974a0887966fcd8b9033e05b12808fee007e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三直线求作三角形其每两线并大于一线也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"画三条直线形成一个三角形，其中其两条线都大于一条线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-22.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-22","revisionId":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af2d7aebda6b3ea9cca4327b68fad27cd4dd10b0e8f72f1d03ce2ea131a7fc43","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：甲乙丙三线其第一第二线并大于第三线〈若两线比第三线或等或小即不能作三角形见本篇二十〉求作三角形先任作丁戊线长于三线并次以甲为度从丁截取丁巳线〈本篇三〉以乙为度从己截取己庚线以丙为度从庚截取庚辛线次以己为心丁为界作丁壬癸圜以庚为心辛为界作辛壬癸圜其两圜相遇下为壬上为癸末以庚巳为底作癸庚癸巳两直线即得己癸庚三角形〈用壬亦可作线若丁壬癸圜不到子辛壬癸圜不到丑即是两或等或小于第三线不成三角形〉〈矣〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"画法如下：甲乙丙 有三条线，第一条和第二条线都大于第三条线 〈若两线比第三线或等或小即不能作三角形见本篇二十〉 以找到三角形。首先，画出比第三条线长的 丁戊，然后用 甲 作为度量从 丁 截取 丁巳 线，从 乙 截取 〈本篇三〉 线，从 己 截取 己庚 线，从 丙 截取 己庚 线，从 庚 截取 丙 线，以 己 为中心、丁 为边界画 庚辛 号线，以 庚 为中心、辛 为边界画圆 辛壬癸。当两个圆相交时，下圆为 壬，上线为 癸5，上面为 癸5，最后一条线为 庚巳 作为底边，画 癸庚癸巳 作为底边，从而得到三角形 己癸庚 〈用壬亦可作线若丁壬癸圆不到子辛壬癸圆不到丑即是两或等或小于第三线不成三角形〉〈矣〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-22.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-22","revisionId":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b240b12876d2baf777848aec2e36737122097d7850a8586d7de22899eac44d28","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：此角形之丁己己癸线皆同圜之半径等〈界说十五〉则己癸与甲等庚辛庚癸线亦皆同圜之半径等则庚癸与丙等己庚元以乙为度则角形三线与所设三线等用法任以一线为底以底之一界为心第二线为度向上作短界线次以又一界为心第三线为度向上作短界线两界线交处向下作两腰如所求若设一三角形求别作一形与之等亦用此法"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明确如下：丁己己癸 三角形的各条线段都具有与圆相同的半径。〈界说十五〉 然后 己癸 和 甲 也是圆的相同半径，则 庚癸 和 丙 半径相等。己庚 元。以 乙 作为测量，三角形的三条线等于所设置的三条线。用法是将任意一条线作为底边，以底边界为中心；第二条线向上画为短边界；第三条线以另一边界为中心；第三条线是中心；在两条边界线的交点处，向下画两边。如果所需的三角形设定好并构造了其他形状，也使用相同的方法。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-22.source","contentId":"euclid-1-22","revisionId":"euclid-1-22@raw-e1d02aca178e6d38","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e47226346f04f98c59bb7f88998c3ef4c2d37263db75976af9ba69b6c6fc0c54","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.22/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.22\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-22:euclid-1-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-22","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-22.statement"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.22","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.22/","sourceLabel":"I. 20"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-22:euclid-1-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-22","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-22.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.22","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.22/","sourceLabel":"I. 3"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-1-22:euclid-1-20:explicit","id":"euclid-1-20","book":1,"number":20,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角不等式：两边之和大于第三边","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-1-22:euclid-1-3:explicit","id":"euclid-1-3","book":1,"number":3,"kind":"proposition","title":"从长线段截取与短线段相等的部分","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-triangle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
